# Windsurf Cascade Guidelines — paper-to-learning-path

When processing user requests regarding research papers (PDFs), paper translations, or research learning guides:
- Activate the skill at `.agents/skills/paper-to-learning-path/SKILL.md`.
- Run pipeline scripts via python terminal:
  - `python .agents/skills/paper-to-learning-path/scripts/extract_pdf.py`
  - `python .agents/skills/paper-to-learning-path/scripts/translate_content.py`
  - `python .agents/skills/paper-to-learning-path/scripts/render_html.py`
  - `python .agents/skills/paper-to-learning-path/scripts/analyze_paper.py`
  - `python .agents/skills/paper-to-learning-path/scripts/generate_learning_path.py`
- Ensure all LaTeX math expressions are rendered via KaTeX without translation alterations.
